@host = http://localhost:5281

### 1. Tutti i piloti
GET {{host}}/piloti

### 2a. Un pilota (200, Leclerc)
GET {{host}}/piloti/1

### 2b. Pilota inesistente (404)
GET {{host}}/piloti/99

### 3. Aggiungi Hamilton (200; ripetuta -> 400)
POST {{host}}/piloti
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 3, "nome": "Lewis Hamilton", "scuderia": "Ferrari", "numero": 44 }

### 4. Piloti Ferrari (Leclerc e Hamilton)
GET {{host}}/piloti/scuderia/ferrari

### 5a. Nome vuoto (400)
POST {{host}}/piloti
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 4, "nome": "", "scuderia": "Red Bull", "numero": 1 }

### 5b. Numero fuori intervallo (400)
POST {{host}}/piloti
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 4, "nome": "Max Verstappen", "scuderia": "Red Bull", "numero": 150 }

### 5c. Numero già usato da Leclerc (400)
POST {{host}}/piloti
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 4, "nome": "Max Verstappen", "scuderia": "Red Bull", "numero": 16 }

### 6. Modifica Hamilton (200)
PUT {{host}}/piloti
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 3, "nome": "Lewis Hamilton", "scuderia": "Ferrari", "numero": 45 }

### 6b. Rileggi Hamilton
GET {{host}}/piloti/3

### 7. Modifica pilota inesistente (404)
PUT {{host}}/piloti
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 99, "nome": "Nessuno", "scuderia": "Nessuna", "numero": 50 }

### 8. Cancella Hamilton (200; ripetuta -> 404)
DELETE {{host}}/piloti/3
